      "writtenOn": "2026-07-16T22:25:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe it\u0027s actually best for us to set diffThreshold back to 0, so that small visual changes like icon moves are reliably captured across both light and dark goldens. I\u0027ve gone ahead and done that. \n\nHowever, we should be aware as a team that when updating goldens we may occasionally need to temporarily raise this threshold to avoid saving microscopic rendering noise, which can cause a doom loop of endless local vs. remote baseline diffs. I\u0027ve added a comment explaining this.",
